# Layout

Desktop is `md:` (768px). Narrower must work and show everything; it does not have to look good. Full recipe: `docs/RESPONSIVENESS.md`.

```tsx
// ✅ stack, then desktop grid
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">

// ✅ flex child that holds a table / long text
<div className="min-w-0 flex-1">

// ✅ table may scroll inside; the page may not
<div className="overflow-x-auto"><DataTable … /></div>

// ❌ page overflow
<div className="flex whitespace-nowrap">
<div className="min-w-[800px]">
```

## Rules

- **One breakpoint: `md`.** Do not add `sm:` / `lg:` / `xl:` layouts.
- **Never `hidden` a control** on narrow unless the same action is in the nav `Sheet` or a wrapping menu.
- **Shell collapse is A2.** `hidden md:flex` on the aside; `md:hidden` button opens F3 `Sheet` with the existing `SideNav`. Do not build a second nav.
- Toolbars and tabs: `flex flex-wrap gap-2`.
- No `100vw`, no page-level `min-w-[…]`.

A Track A screen is not done if 375px shows a page-level horizontal scrollbar or an unreachable action.
